              **STEP 2: PUSH**
              ```bash
              cd {workspace}
              if [ -n "$GITHUB_PAT" ]; then
                git remote set-url origin "https://${GITHUB_PAT}@github.com/mczardybon/mas-engineer.git"
              fi
              git push origin master
              ```

